白肌肤，娇小骨架，甜美感中透着一丝被玩弄的纯真。浅亚麻色长卷发用樱桃发带束成双马尾披散枕间，发丝凌乱沾在脸颊。妆容是甜妹妆——大面积桃粉腮红扫过鼻梁，亮片眼影在泪腺处闪烁，亮泽唇釉涂出刻意的不规则边界。眉头微蹙，迷离眼眸失焦望向虚空，唇瓣微启，神情介于恍惚与沉溺之间。身着一件白色蕾丝洛丽塔洋装，泡泡袖，胸前缎带蝴蝶结系带，薄透面料被胡乱撩起堆在腰间，白色棉质内裤被拉下褪至大腿根处，蕾丝裙摆精致花边紧贴裸露肌肤。她侧卧蜷缩在床上，一侧膝盖蜷向胸口，臀部轻微起伏晃动，呼吸随每一次细微动作而微微急促。洛丽塔少女卧室，蕾丝帐纱从天花板垂落，矮柜上排列棉花糖香水与陶瓷玩偶，床头泰迪熊用丝带蒙眼。构图采用中心对称，少女蜷缩躯体占据画面中央，四周蕾丝与蝴蝶结形成包围感，视线向中心汇聚。"]},{"id":413,"type":"ConditioningZeroOut","pos":[2467.7360051007117,339.71045476416094],"size":[204.134765625,26],"flags":{"collapsed":true},"order":37,"mode":4,"inputs":[{"label":"conditioning","localized_name":"条件","name":"conditioning","type":"CONDITIONING","link":1109}],"outputs":[{"label":"CONDITIONING","localized_name":"条件","name":"CONDITIONING","type":"CONDITIONING","links":[1110]}],"properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.26.0","Node name for S&R":"ConditioningZeroOut","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"input_ue_unconnectable":{},"version":"7.8"},"widget_ue_connectable":{}},"widgets_values":[]},{"id":462,"type":"Text Concatenate","pos":[2442.1109801112034,418.9935567426188],"size":[240,142],"flags":{"collapsed":true},"order":23,"mode":4,"inputs":[{"label":"文本_A","localized_name":"文本_A","name":"text_a","shape":7,"type":"STRING","link":1132},{"label":"文本_B","localized_name":"文本_B","name":"text_b","shape":7,"type":"STRING","link":1131},{"label":"文本_C","localized_name":"文本_C","name":"text_c","shape":7,"type":"STRING","link":1133},{"label":"文本_d","localized_name":"文本_d","name":"text_d","shape":7,"type":"STRING","link":null},{"localized_name":"delimiter","name":"delimiter","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"delimiter"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"clean_whitespace","name":"clean_whitespace","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"clean_whitespace"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"label":"字符串","localized_name":"字符串","name":"STRING","type":"STRING","links":[1130]}],"title":"自动拼接latent路径","properties":{"cnr_id":"was-node-suite-comfyui","ver":"1.0.0","Node name for S&R":"Text Concatenate","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":